        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">The <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Function/Function\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Function()</code> constructor</a> can execute its arguments as JavaScript - it is similarly dangerous as <code class=\"notranslate\">eval()</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This updates the TrustedType information.<br>\nNote, I haven't provided an example. Even though this is notionally safer than not using trusted types, there is really no direction on how you can practically and generically transform a script so that it is safe.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3510273732\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41507\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41507/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41507\">#41507</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42462",
            "title": "TrustedTypes: Function() constructor",
            "date_modified": "2025-12-19T05:59:20.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-12-19T05:57:54.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This improves CSP <code class=\"notranslate\">require-trusted-types-for</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">trusted-types</code> directives by using more current internal links and better cross linking. The <code class=\"notranslate\">trusted-types</code>  also wasn't very clear.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Path of work for <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3510273732\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41507\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41507/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41507\">#41507</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42461",
