        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23019147?u=4c0de81596ced64dc067dea5686f7ca2912db0cb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/Class/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/Class\">@Class</a> pointed out that our <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS#reference\" rel=\"nofollow\">CSS landing page</a>, specifically the Reference section, is missing a link to <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties\" rel=\"nofollow\">Properties</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I noticed a few other issues:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">CSS landing page</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\"Guides\" and \"How to\" sections are missing.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS#tools_for_css_development\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tools</a> section does not list all the tools we have in the sidebar.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS#meta_bugs\" rel=\"nofollow\">meta bug</a> link is not needed on our landing page.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides\" rel=\"nofollow\">CSS guides landing page</a></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>The intro states that it lists guides when it actually lists modules.<br>\nI've updated the text and also added how to get to the individual guides.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML\" rel=\"nofollow\">HTML landing page</a></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Not all <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML#guides\" rel=\"nofollow\">guides</a> are listed. Some of the guides appear in the \"Reference\" section.</li>\n<li>The \"How to\" section is missing.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP\" rel=\"nofollow\">HTTP landing page</a></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\"Reference\" section is before \"Guides\", which doesn't match the order in the sidebar.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">To match the content and order of sections on the landing pages with the sidebar for consistency</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3743584160\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42458\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/42458/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42458\">#42458</a></li>\n</ul>",
