            "date_published": "2025-12-15T23:45:56.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "Moe-Salim91156",
                "url": "https://github.com/Moe-Salim91156"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Address is the dev-docs-needed require requirements of <em><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1864284\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 1864284</a> Allow localhost in MV3 CSP to allow connecting to local dev servers</em> with the addition of:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Notes in the default content security policy page and the manifest content security key page</li>\n<li>release note</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See related BCD changes in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3736654571\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28683\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28683/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28683\">mdn/browser-compat-data#28683</a></p>",
