        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169522277?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This PR fixes the keyboard interaction descriptions for vertical toolbars<br>\nin the ARIA toolbar role page.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Down Arrow now moves focus to the next control</li>\n<li>Up Arrow now moves focus to the previous control</li>\n<li>Removed incorrect references to horizontal toolbar</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #42399.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3729949689\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42399\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/42399/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42399\">#42399</a></p>",
